{{> header title="Your order has arrived" subtitle="We hope you love it" }}

<p>Hello <strong>{{customerName}}</strong>,</p>

<p>Order <strong>{{orderReference}}</strong> has been delivered.</p>

{{> button url=orderUrl text="See your order" }}

<div class="divider"></div>

<h3 style="color: #2C1810; margin-bottom: 12px;">If something is wrong</h3>

<p>Tell us now rather than later. Open the order and raise it there, and we
    will step in while the funds for it are still held. Once the return window
    on the listing has passed, there is far less we can do.</p>

<div style="margin-top: 28px;">
    <h3 style="color: #2C1810; margin-bottom: 12px;">If it is right</h3>
    <p>Leaving a review is the single most useful thing you can do for the
        person who made it — small makers live on them.</p>
</div>

<p style="margin-top: 28px;">Thank you for shopping with us,<br>The {{companyName}} Team</p>
